rsatile use of your Cores. Roll through the ventilations system, solve puzzles and blast though walls to open new paths. Be creative with your Core!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the grenade -\u00a0</strong>Use the Cores in combat to gain the upper hand in battle. Let teammates pull you out of though situations or throw you into tactical positions. Against special opponents, you can use the Outburst explosion in an ultimate offensive strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/56052bf056982ea8178a73d9a1da44f7.poster.avif?t=1759912454\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/56052bf056982ea8178a73d9a1da44f7.webm?t=1759912454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/56052bf056982ea8178a73d9a1da44f7.mp4?t=1759912454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE ANCIENT RUINS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Missions -</strong> Challenge the ancient ruins of KOLEHO, a desert planet shrouded in mystery! Each ruin offers a unique and highly replayable gameplay experience. Explore fallen temples, forgotten cities, abandoned factories as you uncover the secrets of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Guardians -</strong> Beware of the mechanical guardians that dwell in the ruins - remnants of an ancient civilization gone rogue. Each enemy type has unique tactics and actions - coordinate your equipment to resist them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Mysteries -</strong> The ruins hold hidden paths, mechanisms and puzzles that you will need to solve in order to progress. Teamwork is key\u2014 only by working together can you uncover the ruin\u2019s deepest secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/f759e101f5ee51ff454acb72709e2ab9.poster.avif?t=1759912454\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/f759e101f5ee51ff454acb72709e2ab9.webm?t=1759912454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/extras/f759e101f5ee51ff454acb72709e2ab9.mp4?t=1759912454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CORE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fixed classes -</strong> You will earn experience points and high-tech ressources to upgrade your Core. Customize your weapons, equipment and abilities with Core modifications and define your role in the team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll up in style -</strong>\u00a0The Core represents you in REPLICORE. Unlock different cosmetic parts for your Core by completing missions. Mix and match the casing and other components and give it your desired look.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Amberdive Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089890/586adcb4d88265d3e48ebe790aa2d5f6e108b8d4/header.jpg?t=1759912454","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requireme